# nexora-action-code: get_stp
Value Filldown,Required INSTANCE (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value ROLE (\S+)
Value STATE (\S+)
Value COST (\d+)
Value PORT_PRIORITY (\d+)
Value PORT_NUMBER (\d+)
Value TYPE (.+?)

Start
  ^\s*MST${INSTANCE}\s*$$
  ^\s*Interface\s+Role\s+State\s+Cost\s+Prio\.Nbr\s+Type\s*$$ -> Rows

Rows
  ^\s*MST${INSTANCE}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${ROLE}\s+${STATE}\s+${COST}\s+${PORT_PRIORITY}\.${PORT_NUMBER}\s+${TYPE}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
